flowchart LR
 G[Gmail fictional adapter] --> N[n8n Normalize and Store sub-workflow]
 C[Calendar fictional adapter] --> N
 WP[Personal WhatsApp fictional adapter] --> N
 WB[Business WhatsApp fictional adapter] --> N
 L[LinkedIn fictional snapshot adapter] --> N
 N --> V[Local API: schema, identity and date checks]
 V --> D[(Persistent local SQLite)]
 D --> A[n8n local Ollama request]
 A --> Q[Validate exact quote and date]
 Q --> P[Pending commitment]
 P --> D
 CMD[Fictional private owner command] --> AUTH[Owner, user and private chat check]
 AUTH --> R[n8n branch and local command router]
 R --> D
 D --> B[Briefing with evidence and coverage]
 B --> OUT[Private preview only]
 RETRY[Synthetic 429 endpoint] --> ERR[n8n bounded retry]
 ERR --> REC[Recovery result]

 subgraph Approved_Google_Extension[Inactive approved Google extension]
  S[Manual initial sync or n8n Schedule] --> GS[Authenticated anchored window and cursor]
  GS --> GP[Native Gmail profile and Calendar metadata checks]
  GP --> GET[Native read-only Google GET bounded page]
  GET --> NS[Callable normalize and store child]
  NS --> LS[(Separate private SQLite evidence and seen IDs)]
  NS --> ACK[Advance checkpoint only after complete page]
  GET --> RA[Bounded Retry-After or persisted deferral]
  LS --> SP[Newly authored eligible direct span]
  SP --> LA[Native LLM Chain and local Ollama]
  LA --> EQ[Exact span and date validation]
  EQ --> LP[Pending owner confirmation]
  TG[Verified private Telegram transport] --> LG[Exact owner guard and Header Auth]
  LG --> LS
 end
